    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "+ Giao ti\u1EBFp v\u1EDBi c\xE1c NPC: Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i s\u1EBD
    \u0111\u1EBFn g\u1EA7n c\xE1c NPC \u0111\u1EC3 th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n giao ti\u1EBFp.\n  
    - NPC N\xF4ng d\xE2n, ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i c\xF3 th\u1EC3 mua c\xE1c h\u1EA1t
    gi\u1ED1ng.\n   - NPC Nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5, ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i c\xF3 th\u1EC3
    xem c\xE1c nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5, ki\u1EC3m tra ti\u1EBFn \u0111\u1ED9 v\xE0 nh\u1EADn
    th\u01B0\u1EDFng khi ho\xE0n th\xE0nh.\n   - NPC \u0110\u1EA7u b\u1EBFp, ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
    ch\u01A1i c\xF3 th\u1EC3 l\xE0m c\xE1c m\xF3n \u0103n, \u0111\u1ED3 u\u1ED1ng
    khi c\xF3 \u0111\u1EE7 nguy\xEAn li\u1EC7u y\xEAu c\u1EA7u.\n   - NPC Ng\u01B0
    d\xE2n, ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i c\xF3 th\u1EC3 mua m\u1ED3i c\xE2u \u0111\u1EC3
    c\xE2u c\xE1 ho\u1EB7c b\xE1n c\xE1."
